Date: Mon, 12 Jun 2023 15:41:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] UBUNTU: SAUCE: ceph: move mdsmap.h to fs/ceph/

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2032959

The mdsmap.h is only used by the kcephfs and move it to fs/ceph/

URL: https://tracker.ceph.com/issues/61590
Cc: Patrick Donnelly <pdonnell@redhat.com>
Reviewed-by: Patrick Donnelly <pdonnell@redhat.com>
Signed-off-by: Xiubo Li <xiubli@redhat.com>
(cherry picked from https://github.com/ceph/ceph-client.git)
Signed-off-by: Andrea Righi <andrea.righi@canonical.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00086
Ledger-Origin: ubuntu@5577adeac0358e71b7820acbce1d8b6237682d37
---
 fs/ceph/mdsmap.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/fs/ceph/mdsmap.c b/fs/ceph/mdsmap.c
index 8e2937e4e562..a529ba8766fa 100644
--- a/fs/ceph/mdsmap.c
+++ b/fs/ceph/mdsmap.c
@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@
 #include "mdsmap.h"
 #include "mds_client.h"
 #include "super.h"
+#include "mdsmap.h"
 
 #define CEPH_MDS_IS_READY(i, ignore_laggy) \
 	(m->m_info[i].state > 0 && (ignore_laggy ? true : !m->m_info[i].laggy))
